{"release":{"id":392485194,"tag":"v0.37.0","author":"github-actions[bot]","name":"v0.37.0","draft":false,"prerelease":false,"createdAt":"2026-09-20T15:27:36Z","publishedAt":"2026-09-21T07:35:01Z","markdown":"## What's Changed\r\n* Aimdo 0.5.5 + Auto-detect and enable --fast-disk when the disk is fast (CORE-440) by @rattus128 in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16333\r\n* [Partner Nodes] feat(OpenAI): add transparent background support for GPT Image 2 by @bigcat88 in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16366\r\n* Add CFG control to YuE2 Generate Music node. by @comfyanonymous in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16373\r\n* Always put text encoder on GPU when dynamic vram on. by @comfyanonymous in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16374\r\n* [Partner Nodes] fix(Tripo): refuse a P2 run whose linked GLB or FBX output would be empty by @bigcat88 in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16369\r\n* feat: Support MoGe 3 (CORE-443) by @kijai in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16381\r\n* Update comfy-kitchen version to 0.2.35 by @comfyanonymous in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16385\r\n* chores: Update default width and height in EmptyLatentImage by @alexisrolland in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16384\r\n* chores: Update nodes names and categories by @alexisrolland in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16274\r\n* Qwen3/3.5/3.8 cudagraphs and w4a8 gemv support (CORE-390) by @kijai in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/15623\r\n* Fix issue with qwen speedup PR. by @comfyanonymous in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16389\r\n* Lower the pos embed precision of SheetSage2 to match upstream. by @comfyanonymous in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16395\r\n* [Partner Nodes] feat(client): send Idempotency-Key on partner-proxy calls and collect replays by @bigcat88 in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16220\r\n* Bump comfyui-frontend-package to 1.53.6 by @comfy-pr-bot in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16386\r\n* Fix ace step VAE decode crashing on non bf16 GPUs. by @comfyanonymous in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16405\r\n* feat: Qwen-image 2.1 support (CORE-423) by @kijai in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16400\r\n* Update embedded docs to v0.5.12 by @comfyui-wiki in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16396\r\n* Lower wan peak vram when using comfy kitchen attention. by @comfyanonymous in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16418\r\n* Update workflow templates to v0.11.65 by @comfyui-wiki in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16423\r\n* Add a way to disable fast disk for debugging. by @comfyanonymous in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16424\r\n* Update workflow templates to v0.11.66 by @comfyui-wiki in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16426\r\n* [Partner Nodes] feat(Meshy): add Meshy 7.1 support by @bigcat88 in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16412\r\n* Fix MiniMax Music 3 producing noise with CUDA graphs enabled. by @RaynoldVanHeyningen in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16428\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @RaynoldVanHeyningen made their first contribution in https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16428\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/compare/v0.36.0...v0.37.0","html":"<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">What's Changed</h2><a id=\"user-content-whats-changed\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What's Changed\" href=\"#whats-changed\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Aimdo 0.5.5 + Auto-detect and enable --fast-disk when the disk is fast (CORE-440) by @rattus128 in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16333\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16333</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Partner Nodes] feat(OpenAI): add transparent background support for GPT Image 2 by @bigcat88 in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16366\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16366</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add CFG control to YuE2 Generate Music node. by @comfyanonymous in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16373\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16373</a>\n</li>\n<li>Always put text encoder on GPU when dynamic vram on. by @comfyanonymous in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16374\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16374</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Partner Nodes] fix(Tripo): refuse a P2 run whose linked GLB or FBX output would be empty by @bigcat88 in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16369\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16369</a>\n</li>\n<li>feat: Support MoGe 3 (CORE-443) by @kijai in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16381\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16381</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update comfy-kitchen version to 0.2.35 by @comfyanonymous in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16385\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16385</a>\n</li>\n<li>chores: Update default width and height in EmptyLatentImage by @alexisrolland in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16384\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16384</a>\n</li>\n<li>chores: Update nodes names and categories by @alexisrolland in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16274\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16274</a>\n</li>\n<li>Qwen3/3.5/3.8 cudagraphs and w4a8 gemv support (CORE-390) by @kijai in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/15623\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/15623</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix issue with qwen speedup PR. by @comfyanonymous in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16389\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16389</a>\n</li>\n<li>Lower the pos embed precision of SheetSage2 to match upstream. by @comfyanonymous in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16395\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16395</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Partner Nodes] feat(client): send Idempotency-Key on partner-proxy calls and collect replays by @bigcat88 in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16220\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16220</a>\n</li>\n<li>Bump comfyui-frontend-package to 1.53.6 by @comfy-pr-bot in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16386\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16386</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix ace step VAE decode crashing on non bf16 GPUs. by @comfyanonymous in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16405\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16405</a>\n</li>\n<li>feat: Qwen-image 2.1 support (CORE-423) by @kijai in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16400\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16400</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update embedded docs to v0.5.12 by @comfyui-wiki in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16396\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16396</a>\n</li>\n<li>Lower wan peak vram when using comfy kitchen attention. by @comfyanonymous in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16418\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16418</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update workflow templates to v0.11.65 by @comfyui-wiki in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16423\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16423</a>\n</li>\n<li>Add a way to disable fast disk for debugging. by @comfyanonymous in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16424\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16424</a>\n</li>\n<li>Update workflow templates to v0.11.66 by @comfyui-wiki in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16426\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16426</a>\n</li>\n<li>[Partner Nodes] feat(Meshy): add Meshy 7.1 support by @bigcat88 in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16412\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16412</a>\n</li>\n<li>Fix MiniMax Music 3 producing noise with CUDA graphs enabled. by @RaynoldVanHeyningen in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16428\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16428</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\">New Contributors</h2><a id=\"user-content-new-contributors\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: New Contributors\" href=\"#new-contributors\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\"></span></a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>@RaynoldVanHeyningen made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16428\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/pull/16428</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a href=\"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/compare/v0.36.0...v0.37.0\">https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/compare/v0.36.0...v0.37.0</a></p>\n","assets":[{"contentType":"application/x-7z-compressed","size":1595844037,"createdAt":"2026-09-20T16:00:31Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T16:01:44Z","downloadCount":12251,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/releases/download/v0.37.0/ComfyUI_windows_portable_amd.7z"},{"contentType":"application/x-7z-compressed","size":1512836652,"createdAt":"2026-09-20T16:05:08Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T16:06:08Z","downloadCount":5090,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/releases/download/v0.37.0/ComfyUI_windows_portable_intel.7z"},{"contentType":"application/x-7z-compressed","size":1925204508,"createdAt":"2026-09-20T15:55:57Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T15:57:14Z","downloadCount":89164,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/releases/download/v0.37.0/ComfyUI_windows_portable_nvidia.7z"},{"contentType":"application/x-7z-compressed","size":1867201814,"createdAt":"2026-09-20T16:10:25Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-20T16:11:47Z","downloadCount":12713,"downloadUrl":"https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI/releases/download/v0.37.0/ComfyUI_windows_portable_nvidia_cu126.7z"}]}}